{"note": "30mm hand knob with a captured M5 hex nut pressed in from the underside (no glue). Bolt enters from the pocket side, threads through the nut, and exits the top. Key fit decision: the hexagonal pocket's across-flats is set slightly undersize (7.9mm vs nut 8.0mm) to grip the nut's flats and hold it when inverted; the nut's chamfered corners clear the pocket corners. A lead-in hex (8.6mm) guides the nut in. A coupon lets the maker verify press force and retention before the full knob.", "params": {"knob_d": {"value": 30, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Requested knob diameter"}, "knob_h": {"value": 22, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Knob height for finger grip"}, "scallop_count": {"value": 8, "unit": "count", "kind": "design", "source": "design"}, "scallop_r": {"value": 6, "kind": "design", "source": "design"}, "scallop_depth": {"value": 2, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Depth of each finger scallop into the rim"}, "nut_af": {"value": 8.0, "kind": "hardware", "source": "catalog", "note": "ISO 4032 M5 across-flats"}, "nut_h": {"value": 4.7, "kind": "hardware", "source": "catalog", "note": "ISO 4032 M5 thickness"}, "pocket_af": {"value": 7.9, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Across-flats of the press region; 0.1mm undersize on the nut flats for a hand press fit that holds when inverted. Verify with the coupon."}, "pocket_depth": {"value": 5.2, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Depth to closed floor; nut sits 0.5mm recessed from the open face so it is fully inside"}, "lead_af": {"value": 8.6, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Lead-in hex at the mouth, looser than the nut so it starts easily"}, "lead_h": {"value": 0.8, "kind": "design", "source": "design"}, "bolt_clearance_d": {"value": 5.5, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Clearance bore for the M5 bolt shank through the floor to the top"}, "plate_w": {"value": 20, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Coupon plate width"}, "plate_t": {"value": 8, "kind": "design", "source": "design", "note": "Coupon plate thickness"}}, "parts": [{"id": "knob", "role": "final", "material": "PLA", "code": "import cadquery as cq
